    # MC "Sometimes I wonder what kind of secrets are being explored and exploited within it's walls..."
    MC "有时我好奇高墙内究竟在探索和利用着怎样的秘密..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/qst_TheTerminus.rpy:197
